	(text "Keyboard-side socket for e-paper/2.13inch (GDEY0213B74 module, mounted upright on M2 standoffs over the 18650).\nEPM_FPC1 sits on the keyboard FRONT, beyond the 18650 tail, facing the module: the 10P 0.5mm FFC leaves the\nmodule's tail and drops in an S-shape into it, so pins run straight through (pin k = module EP_FPC2 pin k).\nAFD01 is bottom-contact on both boards -> use an opposite-side-contact (reverse, Type B) FFC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 80.01 146.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4e1ff6d9-1397-53ff-bf44-e16f230ab1b0")
	)
